OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns as children seriously ill
OL,4,Aafter beach trips
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It should be a fun activity and a safe
OL,7,Factivity," says Ellie about a trip to
OL,8,Fthe beach with her children.
OL,10,FTwo weeks later, her three-year-old
OL,11,Fdaughter began vomiting and spent five
OL,12,Fdays in hospital after being diagnosed
OL,13,Fwith Hepatitis A.
OL,15,FThe Hampshire mother believes Violet
OL,16,Fpicked up the infection during a family
OL,17,Fvisit to Avon Beach in Dorset.
