OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns as children seriously ill
OL,4,Aafter beach trips
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe is one of three families who say
OL,7,Ftheir children became seriously ill
OL,8,Fafter spending time in and around
OL,9,FChristchurch Harbour during the summer
OL,10,Fholidays.
